Error: Jet.InvalidImageFrom: This `Image` has no `from`
  --> config.jet:1:22
    |
  1 | m: module { image.i: { kind: .Oci } }
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Jetpack images are OCI containers built from a package or an environment
 Fix: Add `from: packages.<name>` or `from: env.<name>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.InvalidImageFrom
